---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Ubuhanga"
  description="Terms of Service for Ubuhanga — a free programming tutorial platform by Techinika."
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="legal-hero__label">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="legal-hero__title">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="legal-hero__subtitle">Last updated: June 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using Ubuhanga ("the Platform"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of
          Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the Platform.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>
          Ubuhanga is a free, open learning platform that provides programming and technology
          tutorials in Kinyarwanda. All content is provided for educational purposes only and is
          available at no cost.
        </p>

        <h2>3. User Conduct</h2>
        <p>When using the Platform, you agree to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Not post abusive, harassing, or inappropriate comments</li>
          <li>Not attempt to disrupt or compromise the Platform's security</li>
          <li>Not use the Platform for any unlawful purpose</li>
          <li>Not impersonate any person or entity</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All video content, tutorials, and educational materials on Ubuhanga are owned by Techinika
          or used with permission. You may view and learn from the content for personal,
          non-commercial use. Redistribution or reproduction without permission is prohibited.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          The Platform embeds videos from YouTube and may display advertisements via Google AdSense.
          These services have their own terms and policies, which we encourage you to review.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          Ubuhanga and Techinika are not liable for any damages arising from your use of the
          Platform. The content is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to update these terms at any time. Changes will be posted on this
          page with an updated "Last updated" date.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about these terms, please contact us at
          <a href="https://techinika.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Techinika.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
    background: var(--color-surface-warm);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-hero__label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-amber-700);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .legal-hero__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-hero__subtitle {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .legal-section {
    padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--color-amber-700);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
    }
    .legal-section {
      padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .legal-content a {
      color: var(--color-amber-400);
    }
  }
</style>
